<title>JAPAN: NHK Spring to announce technical tie-up with IBM.</title>
<headline>NHK Spring to announce technical tie-up with IBM.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese spring maker NHK Spring Co Ltd said on Tuesday that it would announce a technical tie-up with International Business Machines Co at a news conference scheduled for 3 p.m. (0600 GMT).  </p>
<p>The two firms have concluded a cross-licensing agreement on technologies related to suspension springs used in hard disk drives, and have agreed to develop new products using IBM's know-how, an NHK Spring spokesman said.</p>
</text>
